@startuml sequence-auto-status-update

' ========================================================
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - Auto Status Update (Optimistic)
' ========================================================

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    ActorBorderColor #64748b
    LifeLineBorderColor #94a3b8
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #f8fafc
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748b
}

title Sequence Diagram: Auto Status Update (Optimistic UI)

actor Admin as A #fef3c7
participant "Booking Detail\n(React Component)" as Detail #e0f2fe
participant "StatusCard\n(React Component)" as Status #d1fae5
participant "Next.js API\n/api/bookings" as API #fce7f3
participant "Google Apps Script" as GAS #f0abfc
database "Google Sheets" as DB #e2e8f0

== View Booking Detail (Auto-mark as Read) ==

A -> Detail : Navigate to /bookings/[id]
activate Detail

Detail -> API : GET /api/bookings/[id]
activate API

API -> GAS : getBookingById(id)
activate GAS

GAS -> DB : Get booking data
DB --> GAS : Booking data
GAS -> GAS : Check if status == "New"

alt Status is "New"
    GAS -> DB : Update status = "Read"
    DB --> GAS : Updated
end

GAS --> API : Booking with updated status
deactivate GAS

API --> Detail : Booking data
deactivate API

Detail -> Status : Render StatusCard\n(key={currentStatus})
Detail --> A : Tampilkan detail booking

== Click Contact Button (Optimistic Update) ==

A -> Detail : Klik tombol WhatsApp/Email
activate Detail

Detail -> Detail : setCurrentStatus("Contacted")\n(Optimistic update)
Note right of Detail: UI updates INSTANTLY\nbefore API call

Detail -> Status : Re-render dengan key baru\n(key="Contacted")
activate Status
Status --> A : Badge berubah ke "Contacted"
deactivate Status

Detail ->> API : PATCH /api/bookings\n{rowIndex, status: "Contacted"}
Note right of Detail: Fire-and-forget\n(async, no await)

activate API
API -> GAS : handleUpdateBookingStatus
activate GAS
GAS -> DB : Update status column
DB --> GAS : Success
GAS --> API : {success: true}
deactivate GAS
API --> Detail : 200 OK
deactivate API

Detail -> Detail : Open WhatsApp/Email client

alt API Failed
    Detail -> Detail : setCurrentStatus(originalStatus)\n(Revert on error)
    Detail -> Status : Re-render dengan status asli
end

deactivate Detail

@enduml
